Subject: [PATCH] Ownership: in-house model with slate size, availability,
 value, form and calibration from past results; Top Stacks NFL-only

No paid ownership API. The model now:
- scales field concentration by slate size (distinct teams / 2)
- lifts active teammates when a teammate is OUT (availability)
- scores value relative to the player's position
- reflects hot form from past actual vs projected points
- applies a shrunken per-salary-tier correction learned from recorded past ownership
- fetches a larger history window (the old 1000-row cap dropped late-alphabet players)

